  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\because P(x)=(x-3)(x-5)$\r\n$=O(x)+(a x+b)$\r\nGiven, $\\quad P(3)=10$ and $P(5)=6$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad 3 a+b=10$\r\nand $\\quad 5 a+b=6$\r\nOn solving Bqs.\r\n(i) and (ii), we get $a=-2$ and $b=16$\r\n$\\therefore$ Remainder $=-2 x+16$",
    "image": null
